#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:821
msgid "Domain fallback (mirrors)"
msgstr ""

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:822
msgid ""
"Alternative domains per site, tried top to bottom whenever a domain is "
"unreachable or blocked (e.g. s.to → serienstream.to → 186.2.175.5). The "
"first entry is the primary domain and cannot be removed. An IP address is"
" called with the primary domain as its Host header. One entry per line."
msgstr ""

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:826
msgid "Resolve domains automatically"
msgstr "Resolver dominios automáticamente"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:829
msgid ""
"Some sites mint a new numbered domain whenever the current one is blocked"
" (megakino.to → megakino16.com → …). MediaForge looks the live domain up "
"and uses it automatically, so no domain for those sites is shipped at "
"all. Turn this off to use only the lists below — the affected sources "
"then need a domain entered by hand."
msgstr ""
"Algunos sitios crean un nuevo dominio numerado cada vez que se bloquea el"
" actual (megakino.to → megakino16.com → …). MediaForge consulta el "
"dominio activo y lo usa automáticamente, por lo que para esos sitios no "
"se incluye ningún dominio. Desactívalo para usar solo las listas de "
"abajo; entonces habrá que introducir un dominio a mano para las fuentes "
"afectadas."

